   <description>Smoke flow step 9 — mirrors Jira SE-6150: the GPM opens outlook program, selects the smoke supplier, opens Required Documents from the supplier's onboarding checklist and approves each uploaded document; status becomes &quot;Ready to be sent to Funder&quot;. Needs a supplier that has finished step 8.</description>
